Maintainer: Alex Long <johnalexanderlong@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/jalexlong/paperweight-os
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: paperweight-wallpapers
Architecture: all
Depends: paperweight-skel, waypaper, ${misc:Depends}
Description: PaperweightOS wallpapers — Catppuccin themed backgrounds
 Provides wallpapers for PaperweightOS, installed to
 /usr/share/paperweight-os/wallpapers/:
 .
  - Solid-color backgrounds for all four Catppuccin flavours (Latte,
    Frappé, Macchiato, Mocha)
  - Custom artwork wallpapers for Latte and Macchiato, two variants each
 .
 Also installs a sway config fragment (91-wallpaper.conf) that applies
 the active theme's wallpaper on session start and after sway reload.
 The active theme is read from ~/.config/paperweight-os/active-theme.
